  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s immortal ascension, Landscape as Before rises as a fist sized jade ladybug whose back shows rivers and seas on one half and valleys and mountains on the other. He reads it as River as Before and Mountain as Before combined, with their effect elevated. Activated with green grape immortal essence, it restores land around it to the state before an earthly calamity struck.",
        "chapters": [
          611
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Rank six Immortal Gu Landscape as Before can restore any mountain or body of water to a past state, but the furniture inside Dang Hun palace does not count as part of a mountain or body of water.",
        "chapters": [
          651
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_dang_hun_palace"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It also cannot restore man made buildings.",
        "chapters": [
          902
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": []
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When two featherman Gu Immortals threaten to wreck Tai Bai blessed land rather than fight, Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s Immortal Gu Landscape as Before is the perfect solution against that threat, and the two do not know it exists. With it, wherever the blessed land is damaged it can be fixed, so the damage never reaches the point of summoning the winds of assimilation.",
        "chapters": [
          866
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "answer-to-the-feathermens-threat",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_tai_bai_blessed_land"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After soul searching Tai Bai Yun Sheng, Fang Yuan finds no Immortal Gu recipe for Landscape as Before, which confirms those rumors: the Gu forms from heaven and earth resonance when Tai Bai Yun Sheng becomes a Gu Immortal.",
        "chapters": [
          592
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "recipe-search",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_no_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "economy": {
    "canonical_prices": [],
    "price_claims": [],
    "game_proposals": []
  },
  "distribution": {
    "locations": [
      "loc_reverse_flow_river"
    ],
    "factions": [
      "fac_shadow_sect"
    ],
    "origin": "unknown",
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At that point Immortal Gu Landscape as Before has yet to be born. It is an Immortal Gu created by Tai Bai Yun Sheng after he becomes a Gu Immortal, using river as before Gu and mountain as before Gu as the main materials. Vague rumors from Fang Yuan’s previous life say that when Tai Bai Yun Sheng becomes a Gu Immortal, heaven and earth react, Dao marks attract, and the two rank five Gu spontaneously merge into rank six Immortal Gu Landscape as Before, so a recipe may not exist to copy.",
        "chapters": [
          544
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "origin",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_landscape_as_before",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "gu_river_as_before_gu",
          "gu_mountain_as_before_gu",
          "sys_dao_marks"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Among the three solutions Fang Yuan is left with to save Dang Hun Mountain, the third is the time path rank six Immortal Gu ‘A Mountain Like Before’, which has not existed yet and is not naturally formed, its owner Tai Bai Yun Sheng then still a rank five Gu Master in northern plains. Fang Yuan weighs that killing Tai Bai Yun Sheng in northern plains would be only a mild commotion, where abducting a hostage in western desert would have a huge and lasting impact, and he decides northern plains is most suitable.",
        "chapters": [
          425
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "origin",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Landscape as Before and Man as Before belonged to Shadow Sect, passed to Tai Bai Yun Sheng through Purple Mountain True Monarch. Because Shadow Sect had modified Dang Hun Mountain and Luo Po Valley to let certain Immortal Gu work fully there without dao mark conflict, Landscape as Before restores those two domains easily, but Reverse Flow River, which Shadow Sect never held or modified, resists it and yields only a mild effect.",
        "chapters": [
          1302
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "origin-traced-to-shadow-sect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shadow_sect",
          "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
          "loc_reverse_flow_river"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
