  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Among Immortal Gu that could contend with gruel mud Immortal Gu on Dang Hun Mountain, Fang Yuan ranks this time path rank six Gu as the lowest risk plan, because it has not yet been created and its master Tai Bai Yun Sheng is still only a rank five Gu Master.",
        "chapters": [
          545
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "path_time",
          "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fairy Li Shan went back on the mountain pledge agreement she and Dong Fang Chang Fan had made on Miniscule Mountain, and the time path immortal killer move she had prepared only stalls the backlash for a period rather than cancelling it. Hei Lou Lan’s idea is to destroy Miniscule Mountain so that the agreement fails, then, once the backlash is over, ask Tai Bai Yun Sheng to use Landscape as Before to heal the mountain back to its original state.",
        "chapters": [
          814
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "asked-for-to-heal-miniscule-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fairy_li_shan",
          "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
          "loc_miniscule_mountain",
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "This time path Immortal Gu is very much sought after, because something unexpected can appear at any time in the sea areas Eastern Sea Gu Immortals manage and it has outstanding effects there with instant results. Tai Bai Yun Sheng uses the lull after Shark Demon’s defeated invasion of Yu Lu blessed land to meet the many requests he has received.",
        "chapters": [
          893
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "demand-across-eastern-sea",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_eastern_sea",
          "char_shark_demon",
          "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Luo Po Valley is extremely ruined when Fang Yuan stores it in his immortal aperture, but with Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s Landscape as Before it could definitely be restored.",
        "chapters": [
          953
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "confidence-for-luo-po-valley",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_luo_po_valley"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan names Landscape as Before, together with Self Strength and Man as Before, among the Immortal Gu he demands for himself in the trade he forces on Sixth Hair.",
        "chapters": [
          1078
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_self_strength",
          "move_man_as_before",
          "char_sixth_hair"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later advances it to rank seven.",
        "chapters": [
          1683
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Still later he raises it to rank eight, named as the limit of Landscape as Before Immortal Gu, and it remains a time path Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2136
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
